    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26862" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐκαιο-δοσία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>jurisdiction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				20.6.2
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>trial,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλκομένης δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					22.4.2
				</span></i>
			: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς δ.προκαλεῖσθαί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.16.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πρὸς ἀλλήλους δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Milet.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			 No.<i><span class="en">
				154.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(9).903
			</span></i> (Chalcis, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>); <i>administration of
