			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.1.55
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				37.8
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				226.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>international compact for trying suits in the forum rei,</i>
